{"id":"c4d47cb6a6f4ed45","bookSlug":"robot-textbook","relPath":"section_6/section_6.md","title":"第6章 运动学与动力学建模","sections":["正文"],"excerpt":"本平台为双足轮腿机器人，每条腿包含髋关节和膝关节两个旋转自由度，末端为驱动轮。为描述运动，建立以下坐标系：","order":7,"previousId":"8e28b40040396839","nextId":"3b4717c53a5d62fd","html":"<h1 id=\"6\">第6章 运动学与动力学建模</h1>\n<h2 id=\"61\">6.1 坐标系与参数定义</h2>\n<h3 id=\"611\">6.1.1 坐标系定义</h3>\n<p>本平台为双足轮腿机器人，每条腿包含髋关节和膝关节两个旋转自由度，末端为驱动轮。为描述运动，建立以下坐标系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">坐标系</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">符号</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">世界坐标系</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\{W\\}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\{W\\}</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">固定于地面，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">X_W</span><script type=\"math/tex\">X_W</script></span>水平向前，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">Z_W</span><script type=\"math/tex\">Z_W</script></span>垂直向上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">身体坐标系</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\{B\\}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\{B\\}</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">固连于身体质心，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">X_B</span><script type=\"math/tex\">X_B</script></span>沿身体前向，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">Z_B</span><script type=\"math/tex\">Z_B</script></span>垂直身体向上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">大腿坐标系</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\{T_i\\}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\{T_i\\}</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">固连于第<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">i</span><script type=\"math/tex\">i</script></span>条腿大腿，原点在髋关节，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">i=L,R</span><script type=\"math/tex\">i=L,R</script></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">小腿坐标系</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\{S_i\\}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\{S_i\\}</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">固连于第<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">i</span><script type=\"math/tex\">i</script></span>条腿小腿，原点在膝关节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">轮心坐标系</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\{W_i\\}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\{W_i\\}</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">固连于轮子，原点在轮心</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>如图6-1所示（此处以文字描述），机器人工作在矢状面（<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">X-Z</span><script type=\"math/tex\">X-Z</script></span>平面）内，所有关节旋转轴平行于<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">Y</span><script type=\"math/tex\">Y</script></span>轴。身体姿态由俯仰角<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\theta_b</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\theta_b</script></span>描述，定义为身体<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">X_B</span><script type=\"math/tex\">X_B</script></span>轴与世界<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">X_W</span><script type=\"math/tex\">X_W</script></span>轴的夹角。</p>\n<h3 id=\"612\">6.1.2 几何与质量参数</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">参数</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">符号</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">数值</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">单位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">大腿长度</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">l_1</span><script type=\"math/tex\">l_1</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">220</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">小腿长度</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">l_2</span><script type=\"math/tex\">l_2</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">220</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">轮子半径</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">r</span><script type=\"math/tex\">r</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">50</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">身体质量</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">m_b</span><script type=\"math/tex\">m_b</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">2.5</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">单条大腿质量</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">m_t</span><script type=\"math/tex\">m_t</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">0.5</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">单条小腿质量</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">m_s</span><script type=\"math/tex\">m_s</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">0.35</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">单个轮子质量</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">m_w</span><script type=\"math/tex\">m_w</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">0.45</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">身体转动惯量</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">I_b</span><script type=\"math/tex\">I_b</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">0.02</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">kg·m²</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">大腿转动惯量（绕质心）</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">I_t</span><script type=\"math/tex\">I_t</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">0.002</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">kg·m²</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">小腿转动惯量（绕质心）</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">I_s</span><script type=\"math/tex\">I_s</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">0.0015</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">kg·m²</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">重力加速度</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">g</span><script type=\"math/tex\">g</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">9.81</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">m/s²</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>为简化推导，假设各连杆质心位于其几何中心，轮子为均质圆盘。</p>\n<h3 id=\"613\">6.1.3 关节变量定义</h3>\n<p>每条腿定义两个关节角：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>髋关节角</strong> <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">q_{hip,i}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">q_{hip,i}</script></span>：大腿与身体之间的夹角。定义身体直立时<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">q_{hip}=0</span><script type=\"math/tex\">q_{hip}=0</script></span>，大腿前摆为正。</li>\n<li><strong>膝关节角</strong> <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">q_{knee,i}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">q_{knee,i}</script></span>：小腿与大腿延长线之间的夹角。定义小腿完全伸展时<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">q_{knee}=0</span><script type=\"math/tex\">q_{knee}=0</script></span>，小腿后弯（正常站立方向）为正。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>轮子滚动角为 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\phi_i</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\phi_i</script></span>，轮心速度为 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">v_i = r\\dot{\\phi}_i</span><script type=\"math/tex\">v_i = r\\dot{\\phi}_i</script></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"62\">6.2 轮腿机构运动学建模</h2>\n<h3 id=\"621\">6.2.1 单腿正运动学</h3>\n<p>考虑第<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">i</span><script type=\"math/tex\">i</script></span>条腿，以髋关节为原点建立局部坐标系，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">X</span><script type=\"math/tex\">X</script></span>轴沿身体前向，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">Z</span><script type=\"math/tex\">Z</script></span>轴垂直向上。则膝关节位置和轮心位置可表示为：</p>\n<p><strong>膝关节位置</strong>（相对髋关节）：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_k \\\\\nz_k\n\\end{bmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nl_1 \\sin q_{hip,i} \\\\\n-l_1 \\cos q_{hip,i}\n\\end{bmatrix}\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_k \\\\\nz_k\n\\end{bmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nl_1 \\sin q_{hip,i} \\\\\n-l_1 \\cos q_{hip,i}\n\\end{bmatrix}\n</script>\n</div>\n<p><strong>轮心位置</strong>（相对髋关节）：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_w \\\\\nz_w\n\\end{bmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nl_1 \\sin q_{hip,i} + l_2 \\sin(q_{hip,i} - q_{knee,i}) \\\\\n-l_1 \\cos q_{hip,i} - l_2 \\cos(q_{hip,i} - q_{knee,i})\n\\end{bmatrix}\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_w \\\\\nz_w\n\\end{bmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nl_1 \\sin q_{hip,i} + l_2 \\sin(q_{hip,i} - q_{knee,i}) \\\\\n-l_1 \\cos q_{hip,i} - l_2 \\cos(q_{hip,i} - q_{knee,i})\n\\end{bmatrix}\n</script>\n</div>\n<p><strong>轮心相对身体坐标系</strong>：设髋关节在身体坐标系中的位置为 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">(x_{hip,i}, z_{hip,i})</span><script type=\"math/tex\">(x_{hip,i}, z_{hip,i})</script></span>（对于本平台，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">x_{hip,L}=0, z_{hip,L}=-h_b</span><script type=\"math/tex\">x_{hip,L}=0, z_{hip,L}=-h_b</script></span>；<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">x_{hip,R}=0, z_{hip,R}=-h_b</span><script type=\"math/tex\">x_{hip,R}=0, z_{hip,R}=-h_b</script></span>，因为双腿对称安装在身体两侧，矢状面内重合，但实际有宽度偏移，在二维模型中忽略）。则轮心在身体坐标系中的位置：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{w,i}^B \\\\\nz_{w,i}^B\n\\end{bmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{hip,i}^B \\\\\nz_{hip,i}^B\n\\end{bmatrix}\n+\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nl_1 \\sin q_{hip,i} + l_2 \\sin(q_{hip,i} - q_{knee,i}) \\\\\n-l_1 \\cos q_{hip,i} - l_2 \\cos(q_{hip,i} - q_{knee,i})\n\\end{bmatrix}\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{w,i}^B \\\\\nz_{w,i}^B\n\\end{bmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{hip,i}^B \\\\\nz_{hip,i}^B\n\\end{bmatrix}\n+\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nl_1 \\sin q_{hip,i} + l_2 \\sin(q_{hip,i} - q_{knee,i}) \\\\\n-l_1 \\cos q_{hip,i} - l_2 \\cos(q_{hip,i} - q_{knee,i})\n\\end{bmatrix}\n</script>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"622\">6.2.2 身体正运动学</h3>\n<p>世界坐标系中，身体位姿由质心位置 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">(x_b, z_b)</span><script type=\"math/tex\">(x_b, z_b)</script></span> 和俯仰角 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\theta_b</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\theta_b</script></span> 确定。则髋关节世界坐标：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{hip,i}^W \\\\\nz_{hip,i}^W\n\\end{bmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_b \\\\\nz_b\n\\end{bmatrix}\n+\nR(\\theta_b)\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{hip,i}^B \\\\\nz_{hip,i}^B\n\\end{bmatrix}\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{hip,i}^W \\\\\nz_{hip,i}^W\n\\end{bmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_b \\\\\nz_b\n\\end{bmatrix}\n+\nR(\\theta_b)\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{hip,i}^B \\\\\nz_{hip,i}^B\n\\end{bmatrix}\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">R(\\theta_b) = \\begin{bmatrix} \\cos\\theta_b &amp; -\\sin\\theta_b \\\\ \\sin\\theta_b &amp; \\cos\\theta_b \\end{bmatrix}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">R(\\theta_b) = \\begin{bmatrix} \\cos\\theta_b & -\\sin\\theta_b \\\\ \\sin\\theta_b & \\cos\\theta_b \\end{bmatrix}</script></span>。</p>\n<p>轮心世界坐标：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{w,i}^W \\\\\nz_{w,i}^W\n\\end{bmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_b \\\\\nz_b\n\\end{bmatrix}\n+\nR(\\theta_b)\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{w,i}^B \\\\\nz_{w,i}^B\n\\end{bmatrix}\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{w,i}^W \\\\\nz_{w,i}^W\n\\end{bmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_b \\\\\nz_b\n\\end{bmatrix}\n+\nR(\\theta_b)\n\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{w,i}^B \\\\\nz_{w,i}^B\n\\end{bmatrix}\n</script>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"623\">6.2.3 轮地接触约束</h3>\n<p>在轮式模式下，轮子与地面接触，轮心高度恒等于轮子半径：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nz_{w,i}^W = r\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nz_{w,i}^W = r\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>同时，轮子在地面纯滚动，无滑动约束为：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\n\\dot{x}_{w,i}^W = r\\dot{\\phi}_i\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n\\dot{x}_{w,i}^W = r\\dot{\\phi}_i\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>以上约束用于求解轮式模式下的闭链运动学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"63\">6.3 正逆运动学求解</h2>\n<h3 id=\"631\">6.3.1 正运动学函数实现</h3>\n<p>正运动学用于给定关节角和身体位姿，计算轮心位置和足端轨迹。以下为C语言实现：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;math.h&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">typedef</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">struct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l2</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"c1\">// 腿节长度</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x_hip</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z_hip</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 髋关节在身体坐标系中的位置</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">theta_b</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\">         </span><span class=\"c1\">// 身体俯仰角</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x_b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z_b</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// 身体质心世界坐标</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">leg_params_t</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">forward_kinematics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q_hip</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q_knee</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">leg_params_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x_w</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">z_w</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c_b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cosf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">theta_b</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s_b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sinf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">theta_b</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 轮心在身体坐标系</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x_leg</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sinf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q_hip</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sinf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q_hip</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q_knee</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z_leg</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cosf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q_hip</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cosf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q_hip</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q_knee</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x_b_local</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">x_hip</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x_leg</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z_b_local</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">z_hip</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z_leg</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 变换到世界坐标</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x_w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">x_b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c_b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x_b_local</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s_b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z_b_local</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">z_w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">z_b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s_b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x_b_local</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c_b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z_b_local</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"632\">6.3.2 逆运动学求解</h3>\n<p>已知轮心相对髋关节的位置 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">(x_d, z_d)</span><script type=\"math/tex\">(x_d, z_d)</script></span>，求解髋、膝关节角。由单腿几何关系：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nx_d = l_1 \\sin q_{hip} + l_2 \\sin(q_{hip} - q_{knee})\n$$\n$$\nz_d = -l_1 \\cos q_{hip} - l_2 \\cos(q_{hip} - q_{knee})\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nx_d = l_1 \\sin q_{hip} + l_2 \\sin(q_{hip} - q_{knee})\n$$\n$$\nz_d = -l_1 \\cos q_{hip} - l_2 \\cos(q_{hip} - q_{knee})\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">D = \\sqrt{x_d^2 + z_d^2}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">D = \\sqrt{x_d^2 + z_d^2}</script></span>，由余弦定理：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\n\\cos q_{knee} = \\frac{l_1^2 + l_2^2 - D^2}{2 l_1 l_2}\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n\\cos q_{knee} = \\frac{l_1^2 + l_2^2 - D^2}{2 l_1 l_2}\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>因此：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nq_{knee} = \\arccos\\left( \\frac{l_1^2 + l_2^2 - D^2}{2 l_1 l_2} \\right)\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nq_{knee} = \\arccos\\left( \\frac{l_1^2 + l_2^2 - D^2}{2 l_1 l_2} \\right)\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>注意：该公式给出的 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">q_{knee}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">q_{knee}</script></span> 为正值（后弯），且需检查 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">D</span><script type=\"math/tex\">D</script></span> 是否在可达范围内（<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">|l_1 - l_2| \\le D \\le l_1 + l_2</span><script type=\"math/tex\">|l_1 - l_2| \\le D \\le l_1 + l_2</script></span>）。</p>\n<p>髋关节角由下式求解：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nq_{hip} = \\operatorname{atan2}(x_d, -z_d) - \\operatorname{atan2}(l_2 \\sin q_{knee}, l_1 + l_2 \\cos q_{knee})\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nq_{hip} = \\operatorname{atan2}(x_d, -z_d) - \\operatorname{atan2}(l_2 \\sin q_{knee}, l_1 + l_2 \\cos q_{knee})\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>但注意这里的 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">q_{knee}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">q_{knee}</script></span> 是正值，代入时应注意方向。我们重新推导：</p>\n<p>由几何关系可得：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nq_{hip} = \\operatorname{atan2}(x_d, -z_d) - \\alpha\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nq_{hip} = \\operatorname{atan2}(x_d, -z_d) - \\alpha\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\alpha</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\alpha</script></span> 是 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">l_1</span><script type=\"math/tex\">l_1</script></span> 与 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">D</span><script type=\"math/tex\">D</script></span> 之间的夹角，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\alpha = \\operatorname{atan2}(l_2 \\sin q_{knee}, l_1 + l_2 \\cos q_{knee})</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\alpha = \\operatorname{atan2}(l_2 \\sin q_{knee}, l_1 + l_2 \\cos q_{knee})</script></span>。</p>\n<p>C语言实现：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">inverse_kinematics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x_d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z_d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">leg_params_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">q_hip</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">q_knee</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">D</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sqrtf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x_d</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x_d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z_d</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">z_d</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cos_knee</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l1</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l2</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">D</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">D</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l2</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">cos_knee</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">-1.0f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cos_knee</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.0f</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">-1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">// 不可达</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">q_knee</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">acosf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">cos_knee</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">// 正值，后弯</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">alpha</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">atan2f</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sinf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">q_knee</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">l2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cosf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">q_knee</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">q_hip</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">atan2f</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x_d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">z_d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">alpha</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"633\">6.3.3 轮式模式闭链运动学</h3>\n<p>在轮式模式下，身体质心高度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">z_b</span><script type=\"math/tex\">z_b</script></span> 和俯仰角 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\theta_b</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\theta_b</script></span> 由关节角决定。若双腿对称站立，则 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">q_{hip,L}=q_{hip,R}=q_h</span><script type=\"math/tex\">q_{hip,L}=q_{hip,R}=q_h</script></span>，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">q_{knee,L}=q_{knee,R}=q_k</span><script type=\"math/tex\">q_{knee,L}=q_{knee,R}=q_k</script></span>。由轮地约束 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">z_w = r</span><script type=\"math/tex\">z_w = r</script></span>，可推导身体质心高度：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nz_b = r - \\left[ \\sin\\theta_b \\cdot x_{w}^B + \\cos\\theta_b \\cdot z_{w}^B \\right]\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nz_b = r - \\left[ \\sin\\theta_b \\cdot x_{w}^B + \\cos\\theta_b \\cdot z_{w}^B \\right]\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\theta_b=0</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\theta_b=0</script></span> 时：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nz_b = r - z_w^B = r + l_1 \\cos q_h + l_2 \\cos(q_h - q_k)\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nz_b = r - z_w^B = r + l_1 \\cos q_h + l_2 \\cos(q_h - q_k)\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>可见，通过调节 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">q_h</span><script type=\"math/tex\">q_h</script></span> 和 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">q_k</span><script type=\"math/tex\">q_k</script></span> 可以改变身体高度，这就是蹲起动作的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"64\">6.4 轮腿状态切换约束分析</h2>\n<h3 id=\"641\">6.4.1 支撑与摩擦约束</h3>\n<p>在腿式模式下，轮子锁死作为支撑点，需要满足以下约束：</p>\n<p><strong>摩擦锥约束</strong>：地面提供的水平力 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">F_x</span><script type=\"math/tex\">F_x</script></span> 和垂直力 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">F_z</span><script type=\"math/tex\">F_z</script></span> 必须满足 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">|F_x| \\le \\mu F_z</span><script type=\"math/tex\">|F_x| \\le \\mu F_z</script></span>，其中 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\mu</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\mu</script></span> 为地面摩擦系数（橡胶轮胎与硬质地面 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\mu \\approx 0.8</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\mu \\approx 0.8</script></span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>单腿支撑稳定性</strong>：在单腿支撑相，质心投影必须位于支撑腿轮子与地面接触点附近，否则机器人将倾倒。可通过调节身体姿态和另一条摆动腿的加速度来维持动态平衡。</p>\n<p><strong>切换条件</strong>：从轮式切换到腿式需满足：\n1. 轮子锁死，电磁制动器施加。\n2. 身体速度降低到安全阈值（<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">v &lt; 0.5</span><script type=\"math/tex\">v < 0.5</script></span> m/s）。\n3. 目标障碍物高度在腿式越障范围内（<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">h_{obs} \\le 80</span><script type=\"math/tex\">h_{obs} \\le 80</script></span> mm）。</p>\n<p>从腿式切换回轮式需满足：\n1. 轮子解锁。\n2. 身体姿态恢复水平（<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\theta_b \\approx 0</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\theta_b \\approx 0</script></span>）。\n3. 轮地接触确认。</p>\n<h3 id=\"642\">6.4.2 可达工作空间</h3>\n<p>单腿轮心相对髋关节的可达工作空间为一个圆环区域，外径 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">l_1+l_2</span><script type=\"math/tex\">l_1+l_2</script></span>，内径 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">|l_1-l_2|</span><script type=\"math/tex\">|l_1-l_2|</script></span>（但受关节限位限制）。本平台关节限位：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>髋关节：<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">q_{hip} \\in [-60^\\circ, 60^\\circ]</span><script type=\"math/tex\">q_{hip} \\in [-60^\\circ, 60^\\circ]</script></span></li>\n<li>膝关节：<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">q_{knee} \\in [0^\\circ, 130^\\circ]</span><script type=\"math/tex\">q_{knee} \\in [0^\\circ, 130^\\circ]</script></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>有效工作空间为一扇形区域，可用于越障时的足端轨迹规划。</p>\n<h2 id=\"65\">6.5 动力学模型</h2>\n<h3 id=\"651\">6.5.1 轮式模式简化动力学</h3>\n<p>在轮式模式下，将机器人简化为一个倒立摆模型。身体和腿部的质量集中到质心，质心位于髋关节上方。设等效质量 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">M</span><script type=\"math/tex\">M</script></span>，质心高度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">h_c</span><script type=\"math/tex\">h_c</script></span>，身体俯仰角 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\theta</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\theta</script></span>，轮子驱动提供水平力 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">F</span><script type=\"math/tex\">F</script></span>。忽略腿部细节，动力学方程为：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nM \\ddot{x} = F - M g \\theta\n$$\n$$\nI_c \\ddot{\\theta} = M g h_c \\theta - F h_c\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nM \\ddot{x} = F - M g \\theta\n$$\n$$\nI_c \\ddot{\\theta} = M g h_c \\theta - F h_c\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">I_c</span><script type=\"math/tex\">I_c</script></span> 为质心绕轮轴的转动惯量。该模型用于平衡控制器设计（第7章）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"652\">6.5.2 完整拉格朗日动力学</h3>\n<p>对于腿式模式，需要建立包含4个关节角度的完整动力学方程。采用拉格朗日方法，系统动能和势能分别为：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nT = \\frac{1}{2} m_b (\\dot{x}_b^2 + \\dot{z}_b^2) + \\frac{1}{2} I_b \\dot{\\theta}_b^2 + \\sum_{i} \\left[ \\frac{1}{2} m_t \\| \\mathbf{v}_{t,i} \\|^2 + \\frac{1}{2} I_t \\dot{q}_{hip,i}^2 + \\frac{1}{2} m_s \\| \\mathbf{v}_{s,i} \\|^2 + \\frac{1}{2} I_s (\\dot{q}_{hip,i} - \\dot{q}_{knee,i})^2 + \\frac{1}{2} m_w \\| \\mathbf{v}_{w,i} \\|^2 + \\frac{1}{2} I_w \\dot{\\phi}_i^2 \\right]\n$$\n$$\nV = m_b g z_b + \\sum_{i} \\left( m_t g z_{t,i} + m_s g z_{s,i} + m_w g z_{w,i} \\right)\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nT = \\frac{1}{2} m_b (\\dot{x}_b^2 + \\dot{z}_b^2) + \\frac{1}{2} I_b \\dot{\\theta}_b^2 + \\sum_{i} \\left[ \\frac{1}{2} m_t \\| \\mathbf{v}_{t,i} \\|^2 + \\frac{1}{2} I_t \\dot{q}_{hip,i}^2 + \\frac{1}{2} m_s \\| \\mathbf{v}_{s,i} \\|^2 + \\frac{1}{2} I_s (\\dot{q}_{hip,i} - \\dot{q}_{knee,i})^2 + \\frac{1}{2} m_w \\| \\mathbf{v}_{w,i} \\|^2 + \\frac{1}{2} I_w \\dot{\\phi}_i^2 \\right]\n$$\n$$\nV = m_b g z_b + \\sum_{i} \\left( m_t g z_{t,i} + m_s g z_{s,i} + m_w g z_{w,i} \\right)\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>拉格朗日方程：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\n\\frac{d}{dt} \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\dot{\\mathbf{q}}} - \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\mathbf{q}} = \\mathbf{Q}\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n\\frac{d}{dt} \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\dot{\\mathbf{q}}} - \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\mathbf{q}} = \\mathbf{Q}\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">L = T - V</span><script type=\"math/tex\">L = T - V</script></span>，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\mathbf{q} = [x_b, z_b, \\theta_b, q_{hip,L}, q_{knee,L}, q_{hip,R}, q_{knee,R}, \\phi_L, \\phi_R]^T</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\mathbf{q} = [x_b, z_b, \\theta_b, q_{hip,L}, q_{knee,L}, q_{hip,R}, q_{knee,R}, \\phi_L, \\phi_R]^T</script></span>，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\mathbf{Q}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\mathbf{Q}</script></span> 为广义力。</p>\n<p>由于推导过程冗长，本书推荐使用符号计算工具（如SymPy）自动生成动力学方程。以下为Python示例：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sympy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sp</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># 定义符号变量</span>\n<span class=\"n\">l1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">l2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">r</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symbols</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;l1 l2 r&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">theta_b</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symbols</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;theta_b&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">q_hip</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">q_knee</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symbols</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q_hip q_knee&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x_b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">z_b</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symbols</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;x_b z_b&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">m_b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">m_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">m_s</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">m_w</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">I_b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">I_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">I_s</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">I_w</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symbols</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;m_b m_t m_s m_w I_b I_t I_s I_w&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">g</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symbols</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;g&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># 轮心位置（相对身体）</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x_w</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">l1</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sin</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q_hip</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">l2</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sin</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q_hip</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">q_knee</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">z_w</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">l1</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cos</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q_hip</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">l2</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cos</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q_hip</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">q_knee</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># 世界坐标</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x_w_w</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">x_b</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cos</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">theta_b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x_w</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sin</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">theta_b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">z_w</span>\n<span class=\"n\">z_w_w</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">z_b</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sin</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">theta_b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x_w</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cos</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">theta_b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">z_w</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># 速度</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x_w_dot</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">diff</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x_w_w</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Symbol</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;t&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># ... 后续自动生成动能、势能和动力学方程</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>学习本章后，读者应能够利用运动学模型控制机器人的腿部姿态，并为第7章的运动控制算法提供基础。</p>","headings":[{"level":2,"id":"61","text":"6.1 坐标系与参数定义"},{"level":3,"id":"611","text":"6.1.1 坐标系定义"},{"level":3,"id":"612","text":"6.1.2 几何与质量参数"},{"level":3,"id":"613","text":"6.1.3 关节变量定义"},{"level":2,"id":"62","text":"6.2 轮腿机构运动学建模"},{"level":3,"id":"621","text":"6.2.1 单腿正运动学"},{"level":3,"id":"622","text":"6.2.2 身体正运动学"},{"level":3,"id":"623","text":"6.2.3 轮地接触约束"},{"level":2,"id":"63","text":"6.3 正逆运动学求解"},{"level":3,"id":"631","text":"6.3.1 正运动学函数实现"},{"level":3,"id":"632","text":"6.3.2 逆运动学求解"},{"level":3,"id":"633","text":"6.3.3 轮式模式闭链运动学"},{"level":2,"id":"64","text":"6.4 轮腿状态切换约束分析"},{"level":3,"id":"641","text":"6.4.1 支撑与摩擦约束"},{"level":3,"id":"642","text":"6.4.2 可达工作空间"},{"level":2,"id":"65","text":"6.5 动力学模型"},{"level":3,"id":"651","text":"6.5.1 轮式模式简化动力学"},{"level":3,"id":"652","text":"6.5.2 完整拉格朗日动力学"}]}